    {
      "source": "Decorator to cause a <a href=\"MetadataAwareAspectInstanceFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.aspectj.annotation\"><code>MetadataAwareAspectInstanceFactory</code></a> to instantiate only once.",
      "translation": "装饰器，用于使 <a href=\"MetadataAwareAspectInstanceFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.aspectj.annotation\"><code>MetadataAwareAspectInstanceFactory</code></a> 仅实例化一次。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new lazily initializing decorator for the given AspectInstanceFactory.",
      "translation": "为给定的 AspectInstanceFactory 创建一个懒加载装饰器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Expose the aspect class loader that this factory uses.",
      "translation": "暴露该工厂使用的 Aspect 类加载器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the best possible creation mutex for this factory.",
      "translation": "获取该工厂的最佳创建互斥锁。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create an instance of this factory's aspect.",
      "translation": "创建该工厂方面实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the AspectJ AspectMetadata for this factory's aspect.",
      "translation": "获取该工厂对应切面的 AspectJ AspectMetadata。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>maaif</code> - the MetadataAwareAspectInstanceFactory to decorate",
      "translation": "<code>maaif</code> - 要装饰的 MetadataAwareAspectInstanceFactory",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Higher values are interpreted as lower priority. As a consequence,\nthe object with the lowest value has the highest priority (somewhat\nanalogous to Servlet <code>load-on-startup</code> values).",
      "translation": "较高的值被解释为较低的优先级。因此，具有最低值的对象具有最高的优先级（类似于 Servlet 的 `<code>load-on-startup</code>` 值）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Same order values will result in arbitrary sort positions for the\naffected objects.",
      "translation": "相同的顺序值将导致受影响的对象具有任意的排序位置。",
      "count": 1
